 "notes": "Sparse map of Luka Krnica with the Krnicadive centre at Krnicki porat, the harbour the boat leaves from; shoreline from OpenStreetMap. The reef is dived from the boat and has a shallow shelf and an edge to below 25 m. The dive centre publishes no position or plan for this reef, so it is not drawn; the map is centred on the harbour instead of the old site coordinates in Krnica village, 2.7 km inland. For reference, the published shore facts for the Krnica shore (Obala Krnice, istra.hr site 33): easy entry, rocky and sandy bottom from 3 to 12 m, most interesting at 7-8 m, sea bottom around 29 m further out. ",
